      ],
      "text": "Confidentiality:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " inform the adolescent and parents of the practice's "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "terms of confidentiality and its exceptions (ex, pt safety)"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "; where the adolescent = entitled to confidential care, the clinician generally needs the adolescent's permission to discuss the case w parents; know state/local law [BF4‑AD]."
     }
    ]
